<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Food Court Hub</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <nav id="navbar">
        <a href="#" class="logo">🍔 Food Court <span>Hub.</span></a>
        <div class="navlinks">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#food">Our Menu</a>
            <a href="#prices">Prices</a>
            <a href="#bottom">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div id="home">
        <p class="tag">✦ YOUR CAMPUS FOOD GUIDE</p>
        <h1>Good Food.<br><span>Great Mood.</span></h1>
        <p class="intro">
            Hungry between classes? Discover amazing food,
            explore campus favourites and find your next meal.
        </p>ref="#food" class="button">Explore The Menu ↗</a>
        <p class="small">Fresh flavours. Happy moments. Every day.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title" id="food">
        <p class="tag">MADE FOR YOUR CRAVINGS</p>
        <h1>Something Delicious.</h1>
        <p>From cheesy bites to sweet delights, find your favourite.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="food-container">

        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568901346375-23c9450c58cd?w=800&q=85"
                 alt="Delicious burger">
            <div class="card-info">
                <p class="category">★ CAMPUS FAVOURITE</p>
                <h2>Classic Burger</h2>
                <p>Juicy, cheesy and packed with flavour. The perfect bite for your break.</p>
                <div class="card-bottom">
                    <h3>₹199 <span>/ onwards</span></h3>
                    <a href="#prices">Explore ↗</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579751626657-72bc17010498?w=800&q=85"
                 alt="Fresh pizza">
            <div class="card-info">
                <p class="category">✦ CHEESY GOODNESS</p>
                <h2>Loaded Pizza</h2>
                <p>Golden crust, melted cheese and delicious toppings in every slice.</p>
                <div class="card-bottom">
                    <h3>₹299 <span>/ onwards</span></h3>
                    <a href="#prices">Explore ↗</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="food-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551024506-0bccd828d307?w=800&q=85"
                 alt="Sweet dessert">
            <div class="card-info">
                <p class="category">♥ SWEET MOMENTS</p>
                <h2>Sweet Treats</h2>
                <p>Delightful desserts to make your day a little sweeter.</p>
                <div class="card-bottom">
                    <h3>₹99 <span>/ onwards</span></h3>
                    <a href="#prices">Explore ↗</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div id="special">
        <div>
            <p class="tag">YOUR NEXT FAVOURITE MEAL</p>
            <h1>Cravings don't<br>wait for anyone.</h1>
            <p>Take a break. Grab a bite. Get back to being awesome.</p>
            <a href="#prices" class="button">View Price List ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="special-emoji">🍕</div>
    </div>

    <div id="prices">
        <div class="section-title">
            <p class="tag">GOOD FOOD, FAIR PRICES</p>
            <h1>What's On Your Plate?</h1>
            <p>Check out some campus favourites before your next food break.</p>
        </div>

        <table id="table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Dish</th>
                    <th>Price</th>
                    <th>Our Pick</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>🍔 Classic Burger</td>
                    <td>₹199</td>
                    <td><span class="popular">Popular</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>🍕 Loaded Pizza</td>
                    <td>₹299</td>
                    <td><span class="popular">Cheesy</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>🍩 Sweet Treats</td>
                    <td>₹99</td>
                    <td><span class="popular">Sweet</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>🍟 French Fries</td>
                    <td>₹120</td>
                    <td><span class="popular">Crispy</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>🥤 Chocolate Shake</td>
                    <td>₹150</td>
                    <td><span class="popular">Creamy</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>🍰 Red Velvet Cake</td>
                    <td>₹180</td>
                    <td><span class="popular">Special</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="note">* Prices are illustrative and may vary by food court.</p>
    </div>

    <footer id="bottom">
        <a href="#home" class="logo">🍔 Food Court <span>Hub.</span></a>
        <h1>Eat well. Live <span>deliciously.</span></h1>
        <p>Your campus, your cravings, your food journey.</p>
        <a href="#home" class="back">Back to top ↑</a>
        <div class="footer-line"></div>
        <p class="copyright">© 2026 Food Court Hub · Made with ♥ for food lovers</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>


